g (rel00.0-uc002)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (pkg/format component description, design decisions DD3 and DD6)\n      - docs/specs/product-requirements/ (locate and read the pkg/format PRD -- glob for prd*format*.yaml)\n      - docs/specs/use-cases/rel00.0-uc002-format.yaml\n      - docs/specs/test-suites/test-rel-00.0.yaml (format section)\n\n    files:\n      - path: pkg/format/table.go\n        action: create\n        note: Column alignment for tabular output (ls -l style)\n      - path: pkg/format/color.go\n        action: create\n        note: ANSI color code output for file types and permissions\n      - path: pkg/format/size.go\n        action: create\n        note: Human-readable size formatting (bytes to K/M/G)\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: |\n          Implement column alignment for tabular output as specified in the format PRD.\n          Per ARCHITECTURE.yaml, this covers ls -l style aligned columns. Follow the PRD\n          for exported type names, function signatures, and field definitions.\n      - id: R2\n        text: |\n          Implement ANSI color code output for file types and permissions as specified in\n          the format PRD. Support color codes for the file type categories defined in the PRD.\n      - id: R3\n        text: |\n          Implement human-readable size formatting (bytes to K/M/G/T) as specified in the\n          format PRD. Follow the PRD for unit thresholds and formatting rules.\n      - id: R4\n        text: |\n          All exported functions and types use names and signatures from the format PRD.\n          pkg/format depends only on the Go standard library -- no imports from pkg/sys\n          or pkg/testutils.\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: |\n          Source files split by capability: table.go for column alignment, color.go for\n          ANSI color codes, size.go for size formatting. If the PRD specifies different\n          file organization or type-based file naming, follow the PRD.\n      - id: D2\n        text: |\n          pkg/format is a standalone library with no dependencies on other packages in\n          this project. It uses only the Go standard library.\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build ./pkg/format/... compiles with no errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./pkg/format/... passes with no warnings\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: Column alignment, ANSI color, and size formatting capabilities all have exported APIs matching the format PRD\n      - id: AC4\n        text: No imports from pkg/sys, pkg/testutils, or any external module\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":34546,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"faaca8af-82ff-4837-acc5-10710a914652","uuid":"e733d401-0087-4df6-82c4-358bf2914312"}
